window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":5501,"title":"Chapter 5501: No Fate","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan felt helpless about his girlfriend’s honesty and sighed, \"If Third Brother knew you ignored everyone else, it would break his heart.\"","\"I won’t let Third Brother find out.\" Ye Jian smiled and winked, \"If I don’t say anything and you don’t say anything, Third Brother will never know. Speaking of which, is Third Brother also coming home for the Spring Festival this year?\"","\"I’m not sure, all I need to know is that my future father-in-law is coming back. Before you came down today, you talked to Old Man Xia about us extending our vacation and asked if my future father-in-law would come back for the Spring Festival this year. Old Man Xia then called to ask, and it was a security guard who answered, telling him that my future father-in-law would be on leave. At that moment, I felt like God was on my side.\"","Xia Jinyuan decided not to keep her in suspense, and seeing Ye Jian’s immediate relief, he glared at her with a mix of annoyance and amusement, \"Are you really that afraid of me bringing up the engagement to my future father-in-law?\"","Without disguising her feelings, Ye Jian nodded in reply, \"I am a bit afraid. You know my father plans to keep me at home until I’m twenty-seven or twenty-eight. If you suddenly bring up engagement, I genuinely worry my father will whip you with a belt.\"","\"As long as my future father-in-law agrees, I’d be willing to be whipped ten times.\" Taking advantage of the red light, Xia Jinyuan reached over and ruffled Ye Jian’s hair, \"Baby, I really can’t wait to marry you now.\"","\"If you have the chance, you would definitely discuss it with my father in advance.\" Ye Jian was certain of this, because the man beside her never picked a battle he couldn’t win.","\"Of course, I would ask my future father-in-law in advance, I wouldn’t overstep anyone, especially not my future father-in-law.\" Xia Jinyuan had never thought to play any tricks in front of his future father-in-law, because, he was very aware, that any slight scheming on his part would lead to unbearable consequences.","For example... if they could get engaged after another four or five years, that would also be fine!","Xia Jinyuan had a deep understanding of how formidable his future father-in-law could be. A soft knife that slowly cuts, grinding you down until you’re quaking in fear, and then, with a smile, he would sheathe the knife and say, \"Just kidding,\" leaving you so scared you nearly wet yourself, all the while maintaining his refined and graceful demeanor.","Such prowess was truly fearsome.","Seeing the remnants of trepidation on his face, Ye Jian, sitting in the passenger seat with one hand supporting her forehead, laughed until she couldn’t contain herself.","They left in the morning and returned at nightfall, driving up the mountain road that wound through the silence, surrounded by a vast expanse of white snow. In the expensive capital city, Dan Gui Garden felt like a paradise.","The entire Dan Gui Garden was exceptional in its stillness. Passing several villas, each household was quiet, with red lanterns hanging outside their doors, casting a festive glow that faintly diminished the night’s austerity.","A car approached from the front, and as the two vehicles passed side by side, Xia Jinyuan, focused on driving and talking to Ye Jian, did not notice who the other driver was.","Qin Xiu, however, saw Xia Jinyuan in the light of the headlights, slowing down his speed also let him see Ye Jian in the passenger seat, smiling like a blossoming flower.","Qin Xiu’s hands tightened on the steering wheel, recalling what Qin Ying had said during the day, he let out a barely audible sigh within the car, filled with a bitter taste.","As his sister had said, if it’s not meant to be, it’s not meant to be, harboring it in one’s heart is futile.","The cars passed each other, driving off in opposite directions, just like Qin Xiu and Ye Jian, destined to be an unrequited love on Qin Xiu’s part, never to bear fruit.","\"It’s getting late now, I won’t go in and disturb Grandpa Gen. You should rest early.\" Xia Jinyuan kissed Ye Jian’s forehead and then pecked her lips firmly."]},{"number":5502,"title":"Chapter 5502: Waiting","paragraphs":["Ye Jian’s face blushed unseen in the dark night, but she did not dodge anymore, until Xia Jinyuan let her go, \"Be careful when driving on the road, don’t drive too fast.\"","\"Mm, I’ll come over to pick you up tomorrow morning.\" Xia Jinyuan smiled again as he kissed Ye Jian’s forehead, reluctant to leave, \"Rest early, goodnight.\"","\"Mm, you should also rest early, goodnight.\" Ye Jian, with her hand covering her flushed face to cool it down, carried the bags inside the door, while Xia Jinyuan stood behind her until she entered the family home.","When Ye Jian returned home, she saw the dim lights in the living room. She initially thought the Old Man Xia had already gone to sleep, but unexpectedly, Old Man Xia was still sitting in the living room watching TV.","Ordinarily, Old Man Xia would go to bed at nine in the evening. It was just a bit past nine now. Uncle Fu had urged him once, but Old Man Xia said he wanted to wait for Ye Jian to come back, so Uncle Fu stopped urging and stayed to wait with him.","Seeing Ye Jian return, Uncle Fu immediately stood up from the sofa, \"You’re back, eh? Are you tired?\"","At home, Uncle Fu was always like an elder to Ye Jian, gentle and kind, always caring for her.","Old Man Xia smiled even more kindly, \"Our princess is back. Come, let Grandpa see what you’ve gathered today.\" Anticipating her return, Old Man Xia was happy to wait.","Ye Jian didn’t expect that Old Man Xia and Uncle Fu were both still awake, and she was immediately filled with guilt. She dropped her bags to the floor and sat down next to Old Man Xia, embracing his arms, \"Grandpa, my apologies for making you wait, I will make sure to come back earlier next time.\"","It was past nine and they hadn’t slept, surely because they were worried about her and were waiting.","\"I haven’t waited long, haven’t waited long, I just wanted to see what you’ve got today.\" Old Man Xia observed Ye Jian wearing clothes completely different from when she left, nodding with a smile, \"New clothes, did Little Six pick them out for you? He has good taste, they look nice.\"","Ye Jian pointed at the handbags on the floor, moving closer to Old Man Xia and spoke teasingly, \"Grandpa, when do I not look good? Look, all bought by him, I didn’t even want to buy them, and he was not happy about it.\"","Making her boyfriend look good, it couldn’t be helped, they were getting engaged after all.","It was surely necessary to give Grandpa some peace of mind.","\"Yes, that’s true, our Fu family’s granddaughter looks beautiful in anything.\" Old Man Xia agreed wholeheartedly with Ye Jian’s self-praise. In his eyes, his granddaughter was the best girl, incomparable to anyone, \"Why didn’t Little Six come in for a cup of tea before leaving? It’s late in the night, it shouldn’t be a problem, we have guest rooms at home.\"","He wasn’t an outsider, he was definitely going to be the grandson-in-law, staying over for one night at home wouldn’t be an issue.","\"We all thought Grandpa had already gone to sleep, so he didn’t dare to come in and disturb,\" Ye Jian softly said, \"Tomorrow he will come to our home and play chess with Grandpa.\"","\"Little Six is thoughtful, that’s good, the way he takes care of you, Grandpa is also very reassured. It’s getting late, and you must be tired too, go and rest early,\" Old Man Xia slowly stood up, \"Tomorrow Little Six will come over, he will surely take you out again.\"","Ye Jian helped Old Man Xia to stand, \"Tomorrow we might go to the horse track, but it’s not decided yet, if we go to the horse track, would you like to come with us, Grandpa?\"","\"Hahaha, silly girl, you two go out and have fun, I’m just an old man, why join the fun? If you go to the horse track tomorrow, have a good time. It’s rare to get a rest day, and it’s during New Year’s too, you must have fun, that’s the proper way.\"","The old master certainly didn’t want to follow; the young folks had their way of having fun. If he went along, he might spoil their fun."]},{"number":5503,"title":"Chapter 5503: Guard","paragraphs":["Ye Jian couldn’t accept that, \"Grandpa Xia, Grandma Xia are going, how can you not go?\"","\"That’s just to humor you two. At my age, going to the horse farm, I can’t ride, and I’d just be a burden on you kids to accompany me. I won’t enjoy it, so I won’t go, I won’t go.\" Old Man Xia was skeptical; he knew the couple too well.","\"If Grandpa Xia and Grandma Xia really go, then you must go too. Xia Yunyin’s horse farm is warm; there’s a chess room and a tea room. You can sit inside and watch us ride from the big French windows. Next door, there’s a pattern shooting range, also Xia Yunyin’s place; you could play there for a day.\"","Other old masters might not be tempted, but the idea of seeing his granddaughter ride a horse was very exciting for him, so he asked, \"And the shooting range? Can I see that?\"","\"Yes, yes, yes.\" Ye Jian hurriedly assured, \"You can see everything from inside.\"","The old master was thoroughly convinced, \"Sounds like a nice place. That Xia family’s fifth brother is pretty capable, finding such a place. If the Xia couple goes, then grandpa will join them too.\"","\"But let me make it clear beforehand, you play your games, but please don’t just stay inside because grandpa is there, neglecting to play.\"","\"Okay, I’ll definitely not just stick around, I’ll make sure to have fun. Let me take you back to your room, and we can confirm tomorrow whether we’ll go or not.\" Ye Jian, smiling, helped Old Man Xia back to his room. Seeing her happy made him happy too.","His granddaughter was so thoughtful!","After escorting Old Man Xia back to his room, and having finished washing up, Ye Jian lay in bed with no trace of sleepiness, her mind filled with Xia Jinyuan’s words about their engagement.","The thought always made her nervous; not that she was unwilling to confirm her relationship with Xia Jinyuan. Of course not, she was willing, and they had already met each other’s parents. It was really just a matter of having an engagement ceremony in front of both families and holding a wedding.","She understood very clearly that in this world, she couldn’t find anyone more suitable for her than Xia Jinyuan. Given a second chance at life, this man had become an inseparable part of her world, and she was well aware of his feelings for her.","From acquaintance to love, they had spent so many years together, and it was time to settle down, first getting engaged, then married; step by step, it was actually quite nice.","The Xia family was a hundred percent supportive; the only worry was her own family. Grandpa was easy to talk to, but her father would take some effort. However, Captain Xia said he’d handle it.","Alright, she would let him handle it first. If he couldn’t, she would step in. This would also show Captain Xia’s sincerity, letting her father see his true intention to be with her for a lifetime.","Thinking about it, Ye Jian’s heart settled again.","Her cellphone on the nightstand suddenly rang. Ye Jian immediately got up from the bed, grabbed the phone quickly.","It was a message from Xia Jinyuan, letting her know he had gotten home safely.","Ye Jian returned the message with a smile, \"Okay, get some rest early, see you tomorrow.\" After replying, she hugged the phone and laughed, no different from any other girl with a crush.","Xia Jinyuan, who had just returned to the Xia family’s old residence, was also in a good mood replying, \"Hmm, see you tomorrow. Sweet dreams.\"","\"Tsk tsk tsk, seeing this, one can tell you had a fulfilling day.\" Xia Yunyin, who had been waiting for him to return, approached with a smile, \"What do you think, isn’t the idea your fifth brother gave quite good?\""]},{"number":5504,"title":"Chapter 5504: Making Trouble","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan put away his phone, and even the tenderness at the corners of his eyes completely dissipated. He glanced indifferently at Xia Yunyin, who became visibly uneasy, \"What... what kind of expression is that? Don’t tell me, you had a fight? No, that’s not right; the way you were just now, like you’re on an aphrodisiac, it didn’t seem like a fight at all.\"","\"Little Six, today I was severely lectured by grandma, so don’t you scare me. I’m faint-hearted and can’t take fright!\"","This concerned Little Six’s lifelong happiness and the pressure on him as an elder brother was immense. He was terrified of inadvertently ruining Little Six’s chance at a happy marriage.","After a long while, Xia Jinyuan finally let out a cold \"Hmph,\" \"Fifth brother, keep those ideas to yourself and your girlfriend. Who tries, who knows.\"","\"How are things at the horse ranch? Are we still going tomorrow?\"","His Little Fox liked horse riding and shooting; as for shopping, she really had no interest in it.","Upon hearing that nothing was amiss, Xia Yunyin instantly felt a sense of relief, as if he had eaten a heart-calming pill, \"The day after tomorrow, let’s go the day after tomorrow. Tomorrow I will have someone tidy up the horse ranch well and straighten out the shooting range thoroughly, and we will go over again the day after.\"","\"I’ll also invite some friends, all from the social circles of the capital city. It’s good for you and your sister-in-law to meet and get to know them.\"","Just as Xia Jinyuan was about to agree, he suddenly became vigilant, \"Is there a reason for this?\"","A family outing wouldn’t cause the fifth brother to invite friends from his circle in the capital city for no reason. The friends from the capital city weren’t ordinary friends; each one was either rich or noble.","\"This afternoon, I had two friends call me, saying their mothers had just been inquiring about the Xia family, especially mentioning Little Six. My friends were alert and probed further, and, lo and behold, they found out that my former aunt has been out playing the victim again.\"","\"Now, most of the ladies in the circle know Little Six as the scoundrel who disowns his biological mother. I tell you, Little Six, that mother of yours really can’t stay out of trouble. She schemed against me a few years back, and when that failed, she kept quiet for a while only to stir up trouble again. Your days, I’m afraid, won’t be too peaceful.\"","With a mother holding you back, how can your days be peaceful?","On hearing this, a fierce rage filled Xia Jinyuan’s eyes, darker than the night itself, but soon he regained his composure, \"There’s more to this. Madam Xiao is now trying to recognize me; she wouldn’t do anything that would put her at a disadvantage.\"","\"Are you saying someone is taking this opportunity to make trouble?\" A chill came over Xia Yunyin’s handsome face, and the once cheerful man suddenly revealed a ruthless side only seen in the business world, \"I’ll investigate. Once I find out, I’ll take good care of them.\"","\"Fifth brother, there’s no need to investigate. I’ll meet with your friends tomorrow and see, oh, and do any of your friends happen to be married? If so, please invite their wives over as well.\"","Xia Jinyuan didn’t want to drag Xia Yunyin into the mess. He already had an idea of who was behind the trouble.","\"You have a lead? Can you handle it yourself?\" Xia Yunyin sensed what was left unsaid, feeling somewhat reassured.","\"Mm, one who is not very easy to deal with, but also poses no significant threat. The waters are somewhat deep, and as a businessman, you are not suited to get involved.\"","Xia Jinyuan hinted just enough.","\"Alright, as long as you’re confident.\" The hint was enough for Xia Yunyin to understand that the matter was beyond his means to solve. He was capable, but it wasn’t appropriate for him to step in.","As for what Xia Jinyuan requested, Xia Yunyin could guarantee with assurance. In the capital city, what he had the most was friends: those related to business, mere acquaintances, a few genuine ones, and several who had grown up together and were now successful in their own right. Xia Jinyuan could bring as many friends as he wished to the gathering; Xia Yunyin could arrange that many friends to attend."]},{"number":5505,"title":"Chapter 5505 The Same","paragraphs":["Xia Yunyin left the task to Xia Jinyuan, who felt completely at ease. After chatting for a few more sentences, Xia Yunyin received a phone call and quietly slipped away from the Xia family’s old residence.","Before he left, he didn’t forget to remind Xia Jinyuan to cover for him.","Xia Jinyuan waved his hand, signaling him to leave quickly.","Receiving a call late at night and acting all secretive, it was clear there was something fishy—probably off to some den of vice to enjoy himself.","Xia Jinyuan was well aware and didn’t bother to meddle. He knew his brother’s character through and through; Old Fifth was carefree and tended to spend money like water, but he indeed knew how to earn it. The money was his to spend, and he wouldn’t do anything terrible. On the other hand, if there was a good deed to be done, he could be counted on to take part.","During university, one of his classmates fell gravely ill. The classmate came from a remote village, and it was no small feat for him to have continued his education through high school. The illness was undoubtedly a disaster for the whole family. Later, it was Old Fifth who generously lent a hand. Now, despite being stationed far on the border, that comrade never forgot to write letters to Old Fifth, expressing gratitude for the second chance at life he gave him.","The Xia family had never been one to forget their roots. Each member had their own moral boundaries; they were clear on what was acceptable and what was absolutely off-limits.","Among the siblings in the family, only the fifth brother was the exception, an eccentricity he inherited from their uncle—genetics at play, unchangeable.","After Xia Yunyin left, Xia Jinyuan washed up and went to bed, careful not to disturb the old master and Old Madam who had retired early for the night. It wasn’t until the next day, early in the morning, that he appeared in the courtyard, startling the old master who was practicing Tai Chi.","\"How come you’re at home?\" The old master relaxed his stance, extremely surprised to see his grandson at home, \"Didn’t you go with Little Ye yesterday? How come you’re back already?\"","Xia Jinyuan was also troubled, feeling like all the elders in his family were hoping they’d go out.","\"I came back last night; you and grandma had just gone to rest. I’ll head to Dan Gui Garden after breakfast.\" Xia Jinyuan walked to the center of the courtyard and began practicing Tai Chi alongside his grandfather. \"It’s been a long time since I’ve practiced. Take a look and see if my moves are up to standard.\"","The old master, hearing that his grandson would be visiting Dan Gui Garden later, felt reassured. Seeing him actually practice, the old master was invigorated. \"In the past, you didn’t want to practice with me. Now that I’m not inclined to have you join me, you insist on doing so.\"","\"Your posture is wrong, why are you raising so high? Trying to lift the sky? It should be level with your shoulders, and your horse stance needs to be stable. If your lower body isn’t firm, how were you trained in the unit? You haven’t practiced well yourself, and yet you have the nerve to lead the team?\"","The old master was strict, and by the end of the Tai Chi sequence, Xia Jinyuan had broken out in a warm sweat.","Old Madam watched from a distance for a long time but didn’t go over to disturb the pair. The grandfather, grandson, and grandmother trio were cheerful and harmonious in the courtyard adorned with red plum blossoms defiantly blooming despite the snow.","Over at the Fu family in Dan Gui Garden, very early in the morning, the security guards and Uncle Fu were cleaning up together in preparation for New Year’s Eve. With \"Fu\" character posters and paper-cuts for window decorations and large red lanterns hung around, the place had a festive Spring Festival atmosphere.","Ye Jian joined in the effort, cleaning the furniture and mopping the floors upstairs and downstairs, even occasionally humming a few military songs, clearly enjoying herself immensely.","Singing \"We soldiers are unique in our own way,\" Old Man Xia from downstairs immediately continued, \"It’s because we are all wearing simple uniforms.\" Ye Jian’s laughter raised in volume as she sang, \"We soldiers are unique in our own way...\" Just after finishing the phrase, Uncle Fu and a security guard, who were cleaning in the courtyard, came in and joined in singing, \"Though we say we’re different, actually we’re quite the same, all in the prime of youth, stout-hearted lads.\"","One could say that the house was filled with soldiers!"]},{"number":5506,"title":"Chapter 5506: Worry","paragraphs":["Old Man Xia had been in the air force, Ye Jian was in the army, Uncle Fu had once been an air force quartermaster, and the security staff were Chinese military police. After finishing their song, Old Man Xia burst into laughter, \"When your brother comes back, our family will have the sea, land, air, and military forces all represented!\"","Wiping the stair handrail all the way from the second floor to the first, Ye Jian, smiling brightly, added, \"Wrong, Grandpa, there’s also the tactical police. Have you forgotten Niannian?\"","\"Hahaha, yes, yes, yes, girl, give Niannian a call and ask if she has time to come over to our house. When your brother is home, we should invite Niannian more often.\"","Old Man Xia genuinely liked Zhou Niannian’s personality; she was like a little sun, perfectly warming up their family’s icy exterior grandson. One was warm like sunlight, the other as steady as a mountain, an ideal match!","Years had passed, and Old Man Xia hadn’t given up his initial thoughts.","Ye Jian also wanted to invite Zhou Niannian over, but while wiping a vase with several branches of Red Plum in it, she asked unsurely, \"I don’t know if Niannian has a boyfriend; if she does, it might be inconvenient.\"","\"If she has a boyfriend, then Grandpa will stop thinking about it. None at all, Grandpa has been paying attention,\" Old Man Xia, although retired and at home, still had connections. Old Man Xia, who never used these connections, had specially asked someone to keep an eye out for Zhou Niannian’s situation for his grandson Li Jinnian’s lifelong happiness.","Knowing Zhou Niannian didn’t have a boyfriend, Old Man Xia was relieved.","Ye Jian admired Old Man Xia’s foresight deeply and performed a salute from the TV shows, pressing one fist in the palm of the other hand, and bowed to Old Man Xia from afar.","Old Man Xia, now in good health and with a younger mindset, responded in kind to Ye Jian and, like an erudite hermit, said with a smile, \"Don’t admire me too much, Grandpa has eaten more salt than the water you’ve drunk. This matter won’t stump Grandpa.\"","Uncle Fu listened and could not help bursting out a laugh, though he didn’t have the heart to embarrass Old Man Xia.","Indeed, such matters would never vex Old Man Xia; the key was that he had never used his connections to handle family affairs in his life. Concerned about gathering information on Miss Zhou Niannian, Old Man Xia thought it over for three nights and discussed it with Old Master Qin for half a day before making that call.","In Old Man Xia’s words, for his grandson’s happiness, he was willing to put his old face on the line!","The hands-off Old Man Xia just needed one phone call, and the person at the other end expressed joy the following day by visiting to say that doing a small task for Old Man Xia was his honor.","Zhou Niannian indeed had no boyfriend because she was always waiting for someone, waiting for that person to take more initiative, just a bit more effort, and she would definitely turn into a fireball to give that fellow a good searing, then slowly roast and handle him afterward.","In four days, it would be Chinese New Year’s Eve. Uncle Fu was preparing to go out to buy some food supplies needed for the New Year, along with some fresh fruits and gifts for New Year’s visits. Ye Jian, expressing great interest, felt that as a member of the family, she should also be involved in preparing the New Year goods, so she went along with Uncle Fu, and, worried about Xia Jinyuan visiting and finding no one, she specially made a phone call.","Xia Jinyuan was having breakfast with Old Master Xia and Old Madam Xia, on hearing this, he put down his chopsticks and smiled, \"That’s a good idea, we can go to the horse farm tomorrow. Let’s go buy New Year goods today.\"","He wanted to continue to spend time with Ye Jian, but Ye Jian quickly said, \"No, no, no, you should stay with Grandpa Xia and Grandma Xia. I haven’t even visited the two elders since coming home, and yet I’m always monopolizing their grandson, which isn’t nice.\""]},{"number":5507,"title":"Chapter 5507: Doting Love","paragraphs":["Old Madam wanted to hear Ye Jian’s voice, and as soon as Xia Jinyuan said it was Ye Jian calling, she signaled him to put it on speaker. Hearing Ye Jian’s thoughtful words, Old Madam laughed until she couldn’t close her mouth, saying again and again, \"Girl, your grandparents don’t need any company, let Little Six keep you company. It’s rare for you two to meet, your grandparents can’t monopolize Little Six.\"","Old Madam’s kindly voice came through the phone, and Ye Jian was still a little nervous. Both Old Madam and the old master were very kind. Ye Jian greeted the two elders’ health with poise first. Old Madam and the old master smiled around the phone, exchanging intimate words with Ye Jian.","\"You, it’s rare for you to be home for family festivities. If I remember correctly, this is only the second time you’ve spent New Year’s at home. Last time, you left on either the second or third day of the New Year. Little Ye, don’t worry about Grandma Xia or Grandpa Xia, we’re both in good health. You don’t have to worry, just keep your grandpa company and have a happy New Year.\"","\"Your fifth brother said he’s tidying up the horse farm today; he’ll invite you all to play tomorrow. If you have time, go have fun; if not, after the New Year is also fine. Ten days of holiday should be enough.\"","Commander Xia really liked the righteous spirit Ye Jian possessed and even those clear, glass-like pure black eyes. He always told Old Madam that such pure eyes only belonged to the best of children, and if Little Six could marry Little Ye as his wife, it would be a great fortune for the Xia family.","As the head of the family, Commander Xia had a keen eye for people, and if he said so, he was naturally not wrong.","Old Madam was also sharp in judging people. The first time she saw Ye Jian, she had already decided Ye Jian would be her granddaughter-in-law. Now seeing that Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian were affectionate despite the long distance, the two elders were relieved and did not want to hold up the couple’s reunion by keeping them company.","For them, reunions were too difficult, and as elders, they had to be understanding.","On the other side, Ye Jian, nodding continuously, said, \"I’m preparing to visit the New Year’s market to do some shopping. My father and my brother are both coming home this year. Indeed, it’s going to be a joyous New Year. Grandpa Xia, Grandma Xia, my brother and I will pay a New Year’s visit to you two elders together later.\"","\"Hahaha, very good, very good. When you and your brother come over, our house will be even more lively,\" Old Madam was delighted, laughing while Xia Jinyuan made quiet gestures with his fingers, checking to see how deep the smile wrinkles at the corner of Old Madam’s eyes were.","Then, pretending to be jealous, he said, \"Your grandson is right here, right here. Please spare a few glances, if you would?\"","\"Go on, don’t be an obstruction,\" Old Madam Xia pushed away the head that Xia Jinyuan was leaning in with and continued to chat with Ye Jian, laughing heartily. The two elders set the phone down on the table and sat to each side, looking as if they could chat with Ye Jian for hours over the phone.","Old Man Xia watched with a chuckle.","Ye Jian was going to marry into the Xia family, and having a good relationship with the elders of the Xia family meant happiness for Ye Jian, and it made Old Man Xia even more at ease.","Knowing that Ye Jian was going to purchase New Year’s goods, Commander Xia and Old Madam chatted for about ten minutes before talking with Old Man Xia on this side, while Ye Jian went to the market with Uncle Fu.","The Spring Festival was drawing near. Streets everywhere were adorned with festive décor, and everyone was busy preparing to celebrate this reunion holiday, smiles on everyone’s faces. And all of this was because of the stability of the country.","The country’s stability was safeguarded by Ye Jian and the countless comrades-in-arms. Ye Jian had always been proud to be a soldier. She never regretted choosing this path, never regretted becoming a soldier, a Special Forces operative."]},{"number":5508,"title":"Chapter 5508: Loneliness","paragraphs":["Uncle Fu took Ye Jian to the oldest and most bustling ancient-style street in the capital city, which restored the architectural essence of the Ming and Qing dynasties. With all sorts of New Year’s goods fully stocked—food, utilities, decorations—it was a one-stop shopping experience, and Ye Jian found her eyes darting everywhere.","As Uncle Fu picked out ingredients, he chatted with Ye Jian, \"It’s truly wonderful that you all have come back. I’ve been with the Fu family for so many years, and I haven’t seen Old Man Xia as happy as he has been these past few days in a long time. Every year I want to stay and keep Old Man Xia company, but he’s always reluctant, instructing the security to book my ticket early and personally escorting me to the airport. An Jiaxin, Old Man Xia is in great health now, and you have played a big role in that.\"","\"During the Spring Festival in previous years, your father could occasionally make it back for the celebrations. But most of the time, Old Man Xia was left to celebrate alone in the house. Although people like us are around, we aren’t blood relatives, and I could see the sense of loss in Old Man Xia’s heart.\"","\"Especially seeing the neighboring Qin family always bustling with activity during the New Year, Old Man Xia didn’t know how envious he was. So, when Old Man Xia learned that you would stay for the New Year along with your father and Li Jinnian, he was so excited last night that he couldn’t sleep.\"","Hearing this made Ye Jian feel bittersweet. She hoped that Grandpa Gen could live many more decades, allowing her to take good care of him, \"From now on, I will try my best to make time to come back and spend New Year’s with Grandpa.\"","But some things aren’t as easily achieved as one might hope. The New Year’s she could spend with the elderly might become fewer and fewer, so she resolved to try her best to return every Spring Festival to be with Grandpa Gen.","\"Old Man Xia will certainly be very happy to know this,\" Uncle Fu said with a smile that crinkled his eyes, \"It doesn’t matter when, coming back for the New Year is certainly lively, but coming back any time is just as good. To Old Man Xia, whenever you come back, it’s like celebrating the Lunar New Year.\"","\"I’m really grateful to you for always being there with Grandpa, and for taking care of him on behalf of me and my father. Thank you, Uncle Fu. With you around, we are all very relieved while out on the team.\" Ye Jian sincerely appreciated Uncle Fu; without his attentive care, how could she be at ease?","Uncle Fu chuckled heartily, \"No need to thank me, no need at all. Old Man Xia is my benefactor, and taking care of him is the greatest honor of my life. There’s no need for thanks. Saying ’thank you’ would be too formal.\"","The Huahua Market was crowded, and while Uncle Fu continued talking, he picked out items, occasionally asking for Ye Jian’s opinion on things like couplets and paper-cuts. Whatever Ye Jian liked, Uncle Fu would agree to.","After choosing the couplets, Ye Jian suddenly remembered something, \"Will many people come to visit Grandpa Gen for New Year’s greetings? The last time I was home, quite a few guests came from the Space Academy.\"","\"Yes, yes, this year there might be even more. Students from the laboratory at the school, every year a few representatives and leaders will come. From the first day of the lunar month to the fifteenth, our home is full of people. Everyone knows Old Man Xia usually celebrates the Spring Festival alone, so many of Old Man Xia’s old friends, including former students, come to visit him,\" Uncle Fu answered earnestly, also to put Ye Jian at ease, \"Old Man Xia also likes having guests over, to drink tea and chat, it’s the liveliest time.\"","\"He won’t even need to cook as the food will be prepared by the security canteen and delivered. Old Man Xia just needs to make a phone call in advance to arrange it.\""]}]);
